      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "THE HANDBOOK",
      "narration_text": "Here it is: forty-six pages in twelve sections. Claude drafted it from the program's own pages and from our nine tutorials, and I reviewed and corrected it. It covers getting into every tool, full guides to Suno and Midjourney, the weekly reporting rules, the whole video workflow, and how renewals work. And it opens with a first-week checklist.",
