      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "ACCESS",
      "narration_text": "The part new fellows ask about most is access. Discord comes first, because Suno and Midjourney both sign in through it. Then Canva for design, and Adobe for editing. A month ago, this chain lived in people's heads. Now each link is a numbered set of steps.",
